@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+Install on macOS or Linux:
+
+```sh
+curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gakonst/nanocodex/master/install | bash
+```
+
+Existing installations can run `nanocodex update`. Every binary release asset
+is covered by `SHA256SUMS`.
